mong merchant princes.","external_conflict":"Mara's investigation and the Wardens' opposition in the Toll War threaten to expose her scheme.","arc":"Isolde begins as an unseen puppeteer who sees secrets as currency. Her pivotal moment comes when Mara breaks the alibi she arranged for Cassian, which cracks her scheme. She ends exposed, and her pride and need to be seen as clever are what undo her.","personality_traits":["charming","calculating","vain"],"abilities":[{"name":"Leverage Weaving","description":"She collects and combines secrets so that every victim feels trapped.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_cassian_rook","name":"Cassian Rook","role":"supporting","description":"A broad-shouldered Hollow Circle miller's son, Cassian Rook is in his late twenties, sunburnt, with flour permanently ground into his knuckles. He came to Mistral Docks to fight the Grain Levy and is now a blackmail victim whose alibi for a night of sabotage is suspect.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"Shield his family's mill from the Cartel's grain levy.","goal":"Keep his sabotage of Cartel grain barges secret and still end the levy.","flaw":"He is hot-tempered and lies badly under pressure.","internal_conflict":"He believes in honest farming but has turned to deceit and destruction.","external_conflict":"The blackmailer demands payment while Mara's questions press on his false alibi.","arc":"Cassian starts as a defiant farmer paying a blackmailer in silence. When Mara exposes his alibi, he must choose between running and testifying. He testifies against Isolde, and ends as a man who answers for his sabotage to protect his community.","personality_traits":["stubborn","loyal","hot-tempered"],"abilities":[{"name":"Mill Strength","description":"Years hauling grain sacks have given him great physical strength.","category":"physical"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_isolde_hunt","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Mara Voss hunts Isolde Crane, who is the blackmailer, and each of them is a threat to the other's secrets."},{"id":"rel_isolde_mara_leak","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Isolde Crane leaks Mara Voss's old inspection records to push her off the case."},{"id":"rel_mara_teodor_source","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_teodor_quill","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Mara Voss relies on Teodor Quill for crossing and wind-debt records, though his altered logs make him a risky source."},{"id":"rel_isolde_teodor_leverage","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_teodor_quill","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Isolde Crane holds Teodor Quill's altered crossing logs over him and uses them to force his silence."},{"id":"rel_isolde_cassian_victim","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_rook","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Isolde Crane extorts Cassian Rook over his sabotage of Cartel barges and his false alibi."},{"id":"rel_mara_cassian_suspect","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_rook","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Mara Voss suspects Cassian Rook's alibi and presses him, which turns him from a suspect into a witness."}]}
