r_isolde_crane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Mara Voss hunts Isolde Crane, who is the blackmailer, and each of them is a threat to the other's secrets."},{"id":"rel_isolde_mara_leak","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Isolde Crane leaks Mara Voss's old inspection records to push her off the case."},{"id":"rel_mara_teodor_source","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_teodor_quill","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Mara Voss relies on Teodor Quill for crossing and wind-debt records, though his altered logs make him a risky source."},{"id":"rel_isolde_teodor_leverage","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_teodor_quill","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Isolde Crane holds Teodor Quill's altered crossing logs over him and uses them to force his silence."},{"id":"rel_isolde_cassian_victim","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_crane","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_rook","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Isolde Crane extorts Cassian Rook over his sabotage of Cartel barges and his false alibi."},{"id":"rel_mara_cassian_suspect","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_rook","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Mara Voss suspects Cassian Rook's alibi and presses him, which turns him from a suspect into a witness."}]}
