"A sleek Cartel factor in his fifties with silver-ringed fingers and a tailored storm-coat. He rose from dock clerk to enforcer of the Cartel's most profitable lanes. He is certain the lost city holds cloudstone deposits that would cement the Cartel's power.","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To secure the city's cloudstone for the Cartel and win a seat among its merchant princes.","goal":"Seize the ruins' cloudstone before the Bridge Wardens or anyone else can claim it.","flaw":"Greed makes him ignore warnings and treat people as disposable ledger entries.","internal_conflict":"He fears that without the Cartel's favour he is still the powerless clerk he once was.","external_conflict":"The Toll War leaves the Cartel under pressure from the Bridge Wardens, and he needs this find to prove his worth before the Cartel council.","arc":"Corvin begins as a confident dealmaker who sees the jungle as a resource. When the ruins turn on his hired guards and he is stranded, he must choose between the cloudstone and his life, and he clings to the cargo. The jungle claims him, ending his arc as a cautionary figure whose greed destroys him.","personality_traits":["polished","calculating","impatient","ruthless"],"abilities":[{"name":"Debt Leverage","description":"Binds people to him by buying and calling in their wind-debts.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_isolde_penn","name":"Isolde Penn","role":"supporting","description":"A young cartographer in her twenties from Silverspine Academy, with ink-stained hands and a satchel of charcoal and vellum. She is brilliant but has never left the academy's reading rooms. She is leading the scholarly side of the expedition.","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To chart the lost city and prove that the skybridge network once reached beyond the known isles.","goal":"Map the ruins completely and carry the chart back to the Academy.","flaw":"Naive