harts, she nearly sells them, then burns a false chart in a shielded forge-pit and gives Mara honest, uncertain data instead. She ends as a trusted, honest scholar.","personality_traits":["curious","impulsive","brilliant","anxious"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge Cartography","description":"Charts shifting skybridge networks with uncanny accuracy.","category":"mental"}],"home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens"}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_oren_rival","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_oren_calloway","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Mara Venn opposes Oren Calloway because his tolls strain the Wardens and he wants to monopolise the dreamstone she is trying to contain."},{"id":"rel_oren_mara_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_oren_calloway","target_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Oren Calloway sees Mara Venn as the engineer who stands between the Cartel and the profits of the dreamstone, and works to cut off her supplies."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_mara_ally","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","target_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tamsin Reed turns to Mara Venn for Warden protection against the Cartel's grain levy, an alliance built on shared hostility toward Oren."},{"id":"rel_isolde_mara_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_quill","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Mara Venn mentors Isolde Quill, steadying her reckless curiosity and teaching her to value honest data over impressive claims."},{"id":"rel_oren_isolde_rival","source_character_id":"chr_oren_calloway","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_quill","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Oren Calloway tempts Isolde Quill with payment for her dream-route maps, pressing her toward the dishonesty she is struggling to resist."}]}
