rtel control."},{"id":"rel_corvin_tamsin_levy","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_halloway","target_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reeve","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corvin Halloway imposes the grain levy that threatens Tamsin Reeve's family mill, and she resists him."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_isolde_allies","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reeve","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tamsin Reeve offers Hollow Circle labour to Isolde Vane in exchange for Warden backing against the Cartel."},{"id":"rel_oswin_isolde_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_oswin_pell","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Oswin Pell shares his maps of failing bridges with Isolde Vane and guides her repair priorities, while she pushes him to publish."}]}
