isible, courageous witness who accepts the cost of taking sides.","personality_traits":["curious","earnest","anxious","meticulous"],"abilities":[{"name":"Network Charting","description":"Maps and predicts skybridge network shifts and data patterns.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_tamsin_reed","name":"Tamsin Reed","description":"A weathered Hollow Circle miller in her sixties, with flour-dusted gray braids and a calm, unhurried voice. She leads the quiet resistance to the grain levy from her windmill on The Hollow and remembers the Great Calm firsthand.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"Wants to keep her community fed and independent as it was after the Great Calm.","goal":"Defeat the grain levy and secure a fair shipping rate for Hollow grain.","flaw":"Stubborn pride makes her refuse compromise even when it would save lives.","internal_conflict":"She wants to protect her people but fears dragging them into open conflict.","external_conflict":"The Cartel's grain levy and shipment blockades threaten to starve The Hollow into submission.","arc":"Starts as a patient holdout hoping to wait the Cartel out. When blockades cause a shortage and Kestrel smuggles grain through, she accepts alliance with outsiders and joins the Wardens' hearing. She ends as an open leader of resistance, trading pride for solidarity.","personality_traits":["patient","proud","resilient","wise"],"abilities":[{"name":"Community Organizing","description":"Rallies farmers and millers to act together.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_orsolya_hunts_kestrel","source_character_id":"chr_orsolya_thane","target_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Orsolya Thane hunts Kestrel Vane for stealing the seed-core, using Cartel bounties and toll lockdowns to corner her."},{"id":"rel_kestrel_bram","source_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","target_character_id":"chr_bram_halloway","relati