ecure a promotion by delivering Cartel control over every remote voice and supply line.","goal":"Seize Mara's transmitter and the future signal and sell it to the Cartel's merchant princes.","flaw":"He is greedy and treats people as line items, ignoring warning signs that a deal is too good.","internal_conflict":"He privately doubts that the Cartel will reward him and fears he has spent his career serving masters who would discard him.","external_conflict":"The Hollow Circle resists his levy, and the Cartel council demands results before the season's wind-debt comes due.","arc":"Corin starts as a confident collector who sees the signal as an asset. He comes to the cabin to take the transmitter and hears a transmission that predicts his own ruin if he keeps the equipment. Rattled, he tries to bargain the Cartel's levy for the signal and is refused by Ilsa and Mara. He leaves empty-handed, the first time his greed has cost him something, and chooses to stop pursuing the signal.","personality_traits":["polite","calculating","ambitious"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Leverage","description":"Uses debts and wind-debt records to pressure people into compliance.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_ilsa_mara_ally","source_character_id":"chr_ilsa_brandt","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Ilsa Brandt is Mara Voss's closest ally and supplier, and her protective hovering strains Mara's insistence on independence."},{"id":"rel_corin_mara_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_corin_thale","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Corin Thale targets Mara Voss's transmitter and uses supply pressure to force her to give up the signal."},{"id":"rel_corin_ilsa_rival","source_character_id":"chr_corin_thale","target_character_id":"chr_ilsa_brandt","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corin Thale presses Ilsa Brandt to pay the Cartel grain levy, and she resists him to protect the Hollo